# Cloud / Mobile Agent

When the user works from **Cursor Mobile** or asks for a **Cloud** run:

1. Read root `AGENTS.md` for deploy and POS/print context.
2. Live site updates only after **push to `main`** (Vercel + Render).
3. If they say deploy / live / “kr do” / push — commit focused files and push `origin/main` (no force push, no secrets).
4. AsFix POS Android app loads `https://asfixgear.com/pos` — most UI/print JS fixes need **website deploy**, not a new APK.
5. Keep answers short; end with what to tap on the phone after deploy.
